<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Monday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK			  RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			     3-mths	  6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	 11.80/11.70   12.25 /12.15   12.75 /12.65</p>
<p>BPI			 11.90/11.70   12.50 /12.30   12.95 /12.70</p>
<p>Citibank		  11.75/11.65   12.35 /12.25   12.80 /12.70</p>
<p>Metrobank		 11.80/11.60   12.50 /12.25   12.90 /12.65</p>
<p>Multinational	   11.85/11.65   12.35 /12.20   12.80 /12.70</p>
<p>PNB			 11.80/11.65   12.475/12.35   12.80 /12.70</p>
<p>StanChart		 11.75/11.65   12.30 /12.20   12.75 /12.65</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
